## Risks
- noinline changes the marked ELF layout; csr (opcode) + pc (symbol-name) triggers
  are layout-agnostic - verify T2.
- Fixed-target overshoot if GEMM_REPEAT_FREE too small; the kernel-range assertion
  fails loudly (safe RED). REPEAT=200 gives ~26x margin.
- T7 profile/slice cover the startup prefix, not the kernel proper (pre-existing;
  documented; deeper rework out of scope here).

